@startuml
' PageRank Phase B - Main Iteration Loop

title <size:22><b>PageRank Hardware API Mapping</b></size>\n<size:14>Phase B: Main Iteration Loop</size>

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowThickness 3
skinparam ArrowColor #2E3440
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam RoundCorner 10

skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #6B7280
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #64748B
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupHeaderFontColor #0F172A
  GroupHeaderBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
  MessageAlign center
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DB
  BorderColor #D1A800
  FontColor #3B2F00
}

participant "**<color:white>Host (CPU + DRAM)</color>**" as H #A7934B
participant "**<color:white>CXL Memory Pool + NDP</color>**" as N #4C0099

== <size:16><b>Phase B - Main Iteration Loop</b></size> ==
loop while worker_completion_count != num_compute AND iteration < max_iterations

  group #E6F1FF Step 1 - Host Sends Updated Frontier and Vertex-State to NDP
  note over H
    Using the Active Frontier, Build Partitioned Payloads
    for each CCM partition
  end note

  H -> N : **Operation**: CXL-Write, **Payload**: Frontier Mask Vector
  H -> N : **Operation**: CXL-Write, **Payload**: Vertex-State Vector
  note over N
    Receive Vectors to Sync Local Vertex-State with Host
  end note
  end

  group #F0E8FF Step 2 - Graph Traversal on NDP

  H -> N : **Operation**: PageRank Traversal Kernel, **Payload**: Data Addrs
  note over N
    <b>[VectorOp] Graph Traversal and Update Vector Accumulation</b>
    <code>
    for each neighbor in out_neighbors(vertex):
        LocalUpdateVector[neighbor] += D * VertexStateVector[vertex] / out_deg[vertex]
    </code>
  end note
  end

  group #E9FBEF Step 3 - NDP Sends Partial Updates to Host for Aggregation
  note over N
    Partition Local Update Vector by Destination Compute Node
  end note

  N -> H : **Operation**: CXL-Read, **Payload**: Vertex Mask Vector 
  N -> H : **Operation**: CXL-Read, **Payload**: Update Vector 

  note over H
    <b>[VectorOp] Aggregate updates from all NDP partitions </b>
    <code>
    UpdateVector[vertex] += PartitionUpdate[partition, vertex]
    </code>
  end note
  end

  group #FFF2E5 Step 4 - Host Applies Updates and Rebuilds Frontier

  note over H

    <b>[VectorOp] Update Frontier</b>
    <code>
    FrontierVector = threshold(UpdateVector)
    </code>

    <b>[VectorOp] Apply Updates </b>
    <code>
    pr_vals[n] += UpdateVector[n]
    vertex_properties[n] = D * UpdateVector[n] / out_deg[n]
    </code>
  end note
  end
  
  group #F1F5F9 Step 5 - Global Termination Vote
  H <-> N : ("Global Completion Reduce", {operation: "SUM", values: completion_flags[]})
  end

end

@enduml
